"line":37,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery with grass on the ground and computers displayed on pedestals.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826020/large_2001_Bitstreams_017.jpg","line":39},{"title":"A gallery with grass on the ground and computers displayed on pedestals.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826020/large_2001_Bitstreams_017.jpg","line":39,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery filled with works of art.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826021/large_2001_Bitstreams_024.jpg","line":41},{"title":"A gallery filled with works of art.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826021/large_2001_Bitstreams_024.jpg","line":41,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery with white sculptures displayed on top of tall black pedestals.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826022/large_2001_Bitstreams_011.jpg","line":43},{"title":"A gallery with white sculptures displayed on top of tall black pedestals.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826022/large_2001_Bitstreams_011.jpg","line":43,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A long and rectangular black and white work of art displayed in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826023/large_2001_Bitstreams_010.jpg","line":45},{"title":"A long and rectangular black and white work of art displayed in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826023/large_2001_Bitstreams_010.jpg","line":45,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery filled with works of art.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826024/large_2001_Bitstreams_027.jpg","line":47},{"title":"A gallery filled with works of art.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826024/large_2001_Bitstreams_027.jpg","line":47,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A person looking at a video projection on a wall in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826025/large_2001_Bitstreams_028.jpg","line":49},{"title":"A person looking at a video projection on a wall in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826025/large_2001_Bitstreams_028.jpg","line":49,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A television set hanging from the ceiling in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826026/large_2001_Bitstreams_006.jpg","line":51},{"title":"A television set hanging from the ceiling in a gallery.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826026/large_2001_Bitstreams_006.jpg","line":51,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery filled with monitors on the walls.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826027/large_2001.139_Blake.jpg","line":53},{"title":"A gallery filled with monitors on the walls.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826027/large_2001.139_Blake.jpg","line":53,"embedded":true},{"title":"![A gallery lit in blue and red hued lights, along with six monitors each displaying a colored circle.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826028/large_2000.193_Thater.jpg","line":55},{"title":"A gallery lit in blue and red hued lights, along with six monitors each displaying a colored circle.","target":"https://whitneymedia.org/assets/image/826028/large_2000.193_Thater.jpg","line":55,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"BitStreams","source":"https://whitney.org/exhibitions/bitstreams","author":null,"published":"2001-06-09","created":"2026-08-21","description":"Nothing since the invention of photography has had a greater impact on artistic practice than the emergence of digital technologies. BitStreams is a provocative and stimulating presentation of contemporary art that harnesses digital media to achieve new dimensions of artistic expression through the transformation of images, space, data, and sound. The exhibition also illuminates the fascinating crossovers among media, as photography, film, video, installation, sculpture, and sound develop closer connections through their common use of digital software. Among the forty-nine artists included are: Jeremy Blake, Leah Gilliam, LOT/EK, Paul D. Miller (DJ Spooky That Subliminal Kid), Jim O'Rourke, Paul Pfeiffer, Marina Rosenfeld, Elliott Sharp, Diana Thater, and Pamela Z.","tags":["#clippings"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"Clippings/BitStreams.md"},
